OL,3,GNEWSAReform donor tied to #16m of
OL,4,Aproperty in Guernsey
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK's largest donor has been
OL,7,Flinked to more than #16m of property
OL,8,Fand land in Guernsey including the site
OL,9,Fof a former seafront restaurant that
OL,10,Fburnt down.
OL,12,FRecords examined by the BBC show
OL,13,FBritish-Thai businessman Christopher
OL,14,FHarborne is linked to seven properties,
OL,15,Fseveral plots of land, private jets and
OL,16,Fan aircraft hangar development at
OL,17,FGuernsey Airport.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
