OL,3,GNEWSAReform donor tied to #16m of
OL,4,Aproperty in Guernsey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe most recent transaction linked to
OL,7,FHarborne is the #2.5m sale of the
OL,8,Fformer Octopus restaurant site in St
OL,9,FPeter Port, which was destroyed in a
OL,10,Flarge fire in February 2024.
OL,12,FThe BBC asked Harborne's lawyers
OL,13,Fwhether he was behind the purchase but
OL,14,Fdid not receive a response.
